<p>Hello,</p>

<% if @role == "client" %>
  <p> A new user <strong><%= @user.email %></strong> has signed up for the system to be a client. </p>
<% else %>
  <p> A new user <strong><%= @user.email %></strong> has signed up for the system to be an operator. </p>
<% end %>

<p>Additional comments from the user:</p>
<p><%= @comment %></p>